        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this bright and spacious Double Ensuite Room in a well-maintained 4-Bed Property located on the highly sought-after Palmerstown Drive, Dublin 20.\n\nThis superb accommodation offers a comfortable and modern living environment, with the benefit of a private ensuite bathroom. The property is shared with a small number of housemates and features a welcoming living area, fully fitted kitchen, and excellent communal spaces throughout.\n\nPalmerstown Drive enjoys an exceptionally convenient location, with a host of local amenities within walking distance including shops, cafés, restaurants, sports and leisure facilities. Liffey Valley Shopping Centre is just a short drive away, while Dublin City Centre is easily accessible via excellent public transport links. The M50, N4 and N7 road networks are all within minutes, making commuting straightforward.\n\nThis room is ideal for a single professional seeking comfortable accommodation in a convenient and well-connected location.\n\nFeatures:\n•Double Bedroom with Ensuite Bathroom\n•Fully Furnished\n•Shared Access to Fully Fitted Kitchen\n•Comfortable Communal Living Area\n•Bright & Spacious Property\n•Excellent Condition Throughout\n•All Bills Information Available on Enquiry\n•Ample Local Amenities Nearby\n•Excellent Transport Links\n•Easy Access to M50, N4 & N7\n•Liffey Valley Shopping Centre Close By\n•Dublin City Centre Easily Accessible\n•Viewing Highly Advised\n\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS PREFER EMAIL ENQUIRIES AS IT IS EASIER TO MANAGE. PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION AND CLICK 'SEND MESSAGE'. WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS AS THEY ARISE.\n"
      },
